---
source: crates/platitude-core/src/highlight/tree/tests.rs
description: "Each sample line (`|`) over the role of each of its characters: c comment, k keyword, t type, f function, s string, n constant, a annotation, blank plain."
---
| # A comment.
  cccccccccccc
| ! Another comment.
  cccccccccccccccccc
| key=value
      sssss
| spaced.key = spaced value
               ssssssssssss
| colon:value
        sssss
| escaped=line\
          ssss
|   continued
  sssssssssss
| unicode=A
          s
| empty=
